; Modular ERB: OMOGATARI/TALENT_INFO_NAS.ERB
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;Talent info strings for eraNAS
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;Replaced strings to *again* reduce merge conflicts
